 s\, and controversies. \n\nIn this eye-opening book\, digital studies scho
 lar Angèle Christin demystifies the content creator economy\, explaining 
 its long history and the pitfalls of its professionalization. Drawing on i
 n-depth fieldwork with digital creators as varied as vegan YouTubers\, dad
 s of Instagram\, and self-described drama commentators\, Christin shows ho
 w individuals enter social media creation\, how they make money\, and how 
 their online environments shape their content.
